# Route: guide 17 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 37 to
# 39, 34 quests, 5.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Arathi Highlands): Faldir's Cove -> Hammerfall -> Circle of East
# Binding -> Hammerfall -> Witherbark Village -> Boulderfist Hall ->
# Hammerfall -> Boulderfist Hall -> Hammerfall -> Northfold Manor -> Circle of
# West Binding -> Circle of Inner Binding -> Hammerfall -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Call to Arms (679; Boulderfist
# Shaman 38-39, Boulderfist Lord 39-40); The Real Threat (680; Or'Kalar 40);
# Breaking the Keystone (652; Fozruk 42); Sigil of Strom (639; Syndicate
# Prowler 36-37, Syndicate Conjuror 35-36, Syndicate Magus 37-38); Foul Magics
# (673; Marez Cowl 40).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 5146 Elemental
# Leatherworking; 6622 Triage.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dragonmaw Rumors (95663).

